{
  "id": "repositories-and-dependency-managemnet-repositories-and-dependency-managemnet",
  "slug": "repositories-and-dependency-managemnet",
  "title": "Repositories and Dependency Managemnet",
  "category": "Build Tools",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "what-is-dependency-management-in-maven",
      "heading": "What is Dependency Management in Maven?",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Definition: Dependency Management is the process of automatically handling external libraries (jars/artifacts) required during compilation and runtime of a project.",
            "Purpose: Avoids manual downloading and version conflicts of libraries.",
            "Where is it declared? In the <dependencies> section of pom.xml, each dependency must define: "
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 43,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "example",
          "heading": "Example:",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "language": "xml",
              "code": "<dependencies>\n  <dependency>\n    <groupId>mysql</groupId>\n    <artifactId>mysql-connector-java</artifactId>\n    <version>5.1.10</version>\n  </dependency>\n</dependencies>",
              "runnable": false
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 0,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "what-are-dependencies",
          "heading": "What are Dependencies?",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Definition: Artifacts (typically JAR files) that your project needs to compile and run.",
                "Maven automatically locates and downloads these from repositories."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 21,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "what-is-a-maven-repository",
          "heading": "What is a Maven Repository?",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Definition: A storage location for all project dependencies (external jars, plugins, etc.).",
                "Repositories serve two roles: "
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/Users/luffy/Desktop/Computer Science/Infosys/Apache Maven/Repositories and Dependency Managemnet/Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image.png",
              "alt": "image.png",
              "originalPath": "Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image.png"
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 16,
          "subsections": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "local-repository",
      "heading": "Local Repository",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Definition: A folder on your computer where Maven caches downloaded dependencies.",
            "Location (Windows): C:\\Users\\<USERNAME>\\.m2\\repository"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/Users/luffy/Desktop/Computer Science/Infosys/Apache Maven/Repositories and Dependency Managemnet/Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image%201.png",
          "alt": "image.png",
          "originalPath": "Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image%201.png"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Custom Location: <localRepository>D:/dev/m2repo</localRepository>"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 17,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "key-facts",
          "heading": "Key Facts:",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Created automatically on the first Maven build.",
                "Enables offline builds if dependencies are already present.",
                "Maven checks the local repo first before reaching out to remote or central repos.",
                "Shared across all Maven projects on the machine."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 37,
          "subsections": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "remote-repository",
      "heading": "Remote Repository",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Definition: A repository hosted on a network server (private/internal or public).",
            "Needs Internet/Intranet to access.",
            "Used if local repository doesn’t contain the required dependency."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 24,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "a-internal-private-repository",
          "heading": "a. Internal (Private) Repository",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Set up and maintained by your organization.",
                "Tools: Nexus, JFrog Artifactory, Apache Archiva.",
                "Used to: "
              ]
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 15,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "configuration-example-settingsxml",
          "heading": "Configuration Example (settings.xml):",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "language": "xml",
              "code": "<servers>\n  <server>\n    <id>nexus</id>\n    <username>user</username>\n    <password>XXXX</password>\n  </server>\n</servers>\n\n<mirrors>\n  <mirror>\n    <id>nexus</id>\n    <mirrorOf>*</mirrorOf>\n    <url>http://<internal-repo-url></url>\n  </mirror>\n</mirrors>\n\n<activeProfiles>\n  <activeProfile>nexus</activeProfile>\n</activeProfiles>",
              "runnable": false
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 0,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "b-external-repository",
          "heading": "b. External Repository",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Exists outside the organization.",
                "Often used when a dependency is not in the internal or central repo."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 17,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "example-pomxml",
          "heading": "Example (pom.xml):",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "code",
              "language": "xml",
              "code": "<repositories>\n  <repository>\n    <id>my-repo1</id>\n    <name>Alfresco DB2 Repo</name>\n    <url>https://artifacts.alfresco.com/nexus</url>\n  </repository>\n</repositories>",
              "runnable": false
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 0,
          "subsections": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "central-repository",
      "heading": "Central Repository",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": false,
          "items": [
            "Definition: A public repository provided by Maven (https://repo.maven.apache.org/maven2).",
            "Contains thousands of popular open-source libraries."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 14,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "key-facts",
          "heading": "Key Facts:",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Access requires an Internet connection.",
                "Maven contacts Central Repository if: ",
                "If behind a proxy, configure settings.xml:"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "code",
              "language": "xml",
              "code": "<proxy>\n  <active>true</active>\n  <protocol>http</protocol>\n  <username>proxyuser</username>\n  <password>proxypass</password>\n  <host>proxy.host.net</host>\n  <port>80</port>\n</proxy>",
              "runnable": false
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 16,
          "subsections": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "transitive-dependency-management",
      "heading": "Transitive Dependency Management",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [],
      "wordCount": 0,
      "subsections": [
        {
          "id": "what-is-it",
          "heading": "What is it?",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "Maven automatically downloads not only the direct dependencies but also the dependencies of those dependencies."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 15,
          "subsections": []
        },
        {
          "id": "example",
          "heading": "Example:",
          "level": 3,
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image",
              "src": "/Users/luffy/Desktop/Computer Science/Infosys/Apache Maven/Repositories and Dependency Managemnet/Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image%202.png",
              "alt": "image.png",
              "originalPath": "Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image%202.png"
            },
            {
              "type": "list",
              "ordered": false,
              "items": [
                "JUnit 4.12 depends on hamcrest-core-1.3.jar.",
                "Maven automatically downloads both JUnit and Hamcrest jars without explicitly mentioning Hamcrest."
              ]
            }
          ],
          "wordCount": 17,
          "subsections": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "dependency-resolution-order",
      "heading": "Dependency Resolution Order",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "When building a project:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "ordered": true,
          "items": [
            "Maven checks Local Repository.",
            "If not found, checks Remote Repository (if configured).",
            "Finally, contacts Central Repository."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "/Users/luffy/Desktop/Computer Science/Infosys/Apache Maven/Repositories and Dependency Managemnet/Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image%203.png",
          "alt": "image.png",
          "originalPath": "Repositories%20and%20Dependency%20Managemnet/image%203.png"
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 20,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "id": "sample-dependency-block",
      "heading": "Sample Dependency Block",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "code",
          "language": "xml",
          "code": "<dependencies>\n  <dependency>\n    <groupId>junit</groupId>\n    <artifactId>junit</artifactId>\n    <version>3.8.1</version>\n    <scope>test</scope>\n  </dependency>\n  <dependency>\n    <groupId>mysql</groupId>\n    <artifactId>mysql-connector-java</artifactId>\n    <version>5.1.10</version>\n  </dependency>\n  <dependency>\n    <groupId>log4j</groupId>\n    <artifactId>log4j</artifactId>\n    <version>1.2.17</version>\n  </dependency>\n</dependencies>",
          "runnable": false
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 0,
      "subsections": []
    },
    {
      "id": "maven-dependency-scopes",
      "heading": "Maven Dependency Scopes",
      "level": 2,
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "table",
          "headers": [
            "Scope",
            "Description"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "compile",
              "Default; available in all classpaths."
            ],
            [
              "test",
              "Available only during test compilation & execution."
            ],
            [
              "provided",
              "Expected to be provided at runtime by JDK/server container."
            ],
            [
              "runtime",
              "Needed only at runtime (e.g., JDBC driver)."
            ],
            [
              "system",
              "Provided by the local system path explicitly."
            ],
            [
              "import",
              "Used in dependency management (mainly for BOMs)."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "wordCount": 50,
      "subsections": []
    }
